        <h1 class="mb-5 max-w-4xl text-4xl font-extrabold leading-tight tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl">Model Context Protocol</h1>
        <p class="mb-3 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-300">AI Agent Integration & Future-Ready Architecture</p>
        <p class="mb-3 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-300">Custom MCP server implementation enabling AI agents to interact with portfolio data and functionality through standardized protocols</p>
