                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">🚀 Live Status: Fully Operational</h3>
                        <div class="space-y-4">
                            <div class="flex items-start">
                                <div class="bg-cy rounded-full w-2 h-2 mt-2 mr-3 flex-shrink-0"></div>
                                <p class="text-slate-300">
                                    <strong>✅ Web AI Assistant:</strong> Integrated directly into this site (Navbar/Side Panel) with Full Screen support and Local LLM switching.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex items-start">
                                <div class="bg-cy rounded-full w-2 h-2 mt-2 mr-3 flex-shrink-0"></div>
                                <p class="text-slate-300">
                                    <strong>✅ LM Studio Optimized:</strong> Fully tested and optimized for LM Studio (v0.3.17+) using the Remote MCP (SSE) protocol.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex items-start">
                                <div class="bg-cy rounded-full w-2 h-2 mt-2 mr-3 flex-shrink-0"></div>
                                <p class="text-slate-300">
                                    <strong>✅ Production Transports:</strong> Supporting both standard Request/Response (POST) and Real-time Streaming (SSE).
                                </p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex items-start">
                                <div class="bg-cy rounded-full w-2 h-2 mt-2 mr-3 flex-shrink-0"></div>
                                <p class="text-slate-300">
                                    <strong>✅ Agent Tools Live:</strong> Search projects, submit contact forms, and read resources directly from your local LLM.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mt-4 p-4 bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg border border-line">
                            <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm">
                                <strong>Technical Status:</strong> The MCP server is running in production with bypassed OAuth for public access. 
                                It is ready for immediate connection from any spec-compliant MCP client.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-8">
            <!-- MCP Overview -->
            <ProjectSection Title="What is MCP?" Icon="fas fa-robot">
                <p class="text-slate-300 text-lg leading-relaxed">
                    Model Context Protocol (MCP) is an emerging standard for enabling AI agents to interact with external systems, data, and functionality.
                    Our implementation provides a JSON-RPC 2.0 compliant server that exposes portfolio data, project search capabilities, and contact functionality
                    to AI assistants through standardized tool interfaces.
                </p>
                </ProjectSection>

            <!-- Technical Implementation -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-8">
                <div class="surface p-6 sm:p-8">
                    <div class="flex items-center mb-6">
                        <div class="rounded-lg p-3 mr-4 bg-cy/10">
                            <i class="fas fa-check-circle text-cy text-xl"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100">Working Features</h3>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="space-y-3">
                        <li class="flex items-start">
                            <span class="text-cy mr-3 mt-1">•</span>
                            <span class="text-slate-300">JSON-RPC 2.0 protocol compliance</span>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start">
                            <span class="text-cy mr-3 mt-1">•</span>
                            <span class="text-slate-300">Project search by category/technology/keyword</span>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start">
                            <span class="text-cy mr-3 mt-1">•</span>
                            <span class="text-slate-300">Contact form submission via email service</span>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start">
                            <span class="text-cy mr-3 mt-1">•</span>
                            <span class="text-slate-300">Resource endpoints for profile & project data</span>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start">
                            <span class="text-cy mr-3 mt-1">•</span>
                            <span class="text-slate-300">Full MCP Inspector compatibility</span>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="surface p-6 sm:p-8">
                    <div class="flex items-center mb-6">
                        <div class="rounded-lg p-3 mr-4 bg-cy/10">
                            <i class="fas fa-plug text-cy text-xl"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100">Platform Status</h3>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="space-y-3">
                        <li class="flex items-start">
                            <span class="text-cy mr-3 mt-1">✅</span>
                            <span class="text-slate-300"><strong>LM Studio:</strong> Fully verified & optimized</span>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start">
                            <span class="text-cy mr-3 mt-1">✅</span>
                            <span class="text-slate-300"><strong>MCP Inspector:</strong> 100% compliance</span>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start">
                            <span class="text-cy mr-3 mt-1">⏳</span>
                            <span class="text-slate-300"><strong>Claude Desktop:</strong> Testing in progress</span>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start">
                            <span class="text-cy mr-3 mt-1">🛡️</span>
                            <span class="text-slate-300"><strong>Security:</strong> Direct SSE / No proxy required</span>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Technical Details -->
            <div class="surface p-6 sm:p-8">
                <div class="flex items-center mb-6">
                    <div class="rounded-lg p-3 mr-4 bg-cy/10">
                        <i class="fas fa-cogs text-cy text-xl"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-100">Technical Architecture</h3>
                </div>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                    <div>
                        <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Server Implementation</h4>
                        <ul class="text-slate-300 space-y-2">
                            <li>• ASP.NET Core Web API backend</li>
                            <li>• JSON-RPC 2.0 message handling</li>
                            <li>• RESTful HTTP transport layer</li>
                            <li>• Comprehensive request/response logging</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Available Tools</h4>
                        <ul class="text-slate-300 space-y-2">
                            <li>• <code class="bg-white/[.02] px-2 py-1 rounded">search_projects</code></li>
                            <li>• <code class="bg-white/[.02] px-2 py-1 rounded">submit_contact</code></li>
                            <li>• Resource endpoints for data access</li>
                            <li>• Schema-compliant tool definitions</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Integration Instructions -->
            <div class="surface p-6 sm:p-8">
                <div class="flex items-center mb-6">
                    <div class="rounded-lg p-3 mr-4 bg-cy/10">
                        <i class="fas fa-code text-cy text-xl"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-100">Integration Instructions</h3>
                </div>
                <p class="text-slate-300 mb-6">For developers who want to integrate with the MCP server:</p>

                <div class="space-y-8">
                    <!-- LM Studio Setup -->
                    <div>
                        <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">🤖 LM Studio Configuration</h4>
                        <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-6 border border-line">
                            <p class="text-slate-300 mb-4">Add the portfolio server to LM Studio by editing your <code class="bg-white/[.02] px-2 py-0.5 rounded">mcp.json</code> file:</p>
                            
                            <div class="mb-6">
                                <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mb-2">1. Locate <code class="text-cy">mcp.json</code> (In LM Studio: Settings → MCP → Open Config File)</p>
                                <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mb-4">2. Append the following to your <code class="text-cy">mcpServers</code> object:</p>
                                
                                <div class="bg-ink rounded-lg p-4 font-mono text-sm border border-line overflow-x-auto">
<pre class="text-cy"><code>"muhammad-portfolio": {
  "transport": "sse",
  "url": "https://mkkai.dev/api/mcp/sse"
}</code></pre>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="p-4 bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg border border-line">
                                <p class="text-cy text-sm">
                                    <i class="fas fa-check-circle mr-2"></i><strong>Verify Connection:</strong> After saving, you should see a green dot next to <strong>muhammad-portfolio</strong> in the LM Studio sidebar.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- MCP Inspector Testing -->
                    <div>
                        <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">🧪 Test with MCP Inspector</h4>
                        <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-4 border border-line">
                            <p class="text-slate-300 mb-3">Use the official MCP Inspector to test the server:</p>
                            <div class="bg-ink rounded-lg p-3 font-mono text-sm border border-line">
                                <div class="text-cy mb-2"># Install and run MCP Inspector</div>
                                <div class="text-cy">npx @@modelcontextprotocol/inspector --transport http --server-url https://mkkai.dev/api/mcp</div>
                            </div>
                            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mt-3">This will open a web interface to test all available tools and resources.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Claude Desktop Setup (Untested)
                    <div>
                        <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">🖥️ Claude Desktop Configuration</h4>
                        <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-4 border border-line">
                            <p class="text-slate-300 mb-3">Add to Claude Desktop settings (Settings → Connectors):</p>
                            <div class="bg-ink rounded-lg p-3 overflow-x-auto border border-line">
                                <pre class="text-sm text-cy"><code>{
  "mcpServers": {
    "muhammad-portfolio": {
      "transport": "http",
      "url": "https://mkkai.dev/api/mcp",
      "description": "Muhammad's Portfolio MCP Server"
    }
  }
}</code></pre>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    -->

                    <!-- Direct API Testing -->
                    <div>
                        <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">🔧 Direct API Testing</h4>
                        <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-4 border border-line">
                            <p class="text-slate-300 mb-3">Test the JSON-RPC endpoints directly with curl:</p>

                            <div class="space-y-4">
                                <div>
                                    <p class="text-white font-semibold mb-2">Initialize connection:</p>
                                    <div class="bg-ink rounded-lg p-3 font-mono text-xs border border-line overflow-x-auto">
                                        <div class="text-cy">curl -X POST https://mkkai.dev/api/mcp \</div>
                                        <div class="text-cy ml-2">-H "Content-Type: application/json" \</div>
                                        <div class="text-cy ml-2">-d '{</div>
                                        <div class="text-cy ml-4">"jsonrpc": "2.0",</div>
                                        <div class="text-cy ml-4">"id": 1,</div>
                                        <div class="text-cy ml-4">"method": "initialize",</div>
                                        <div class="text-cy ml-4">"params": {</div>
                                        <div class="text-cy ml-6">"protocolVersion": "2025-06-18",</div>
                                        <div class="text-cy ml-6">"capabilities": {},</div>
                                        <div class="text-cy ml-6">"clientInfo": {"name": "test", "version": "1.0"}</div>
                                        <div class="text-cy ml-4">}</div>
                                        <div class="text-cy ml-2">}'</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <div>
                                    <p class="text-white font-semibold mb-2">List available tools:</p>
                                    <div class="bg-ink rounded-lg p-3 font-mono text-xs border border-line overflow-x-auto">
                                        <div class="text-cy">curl -X POST https://mkkai.dev/api/mcp \</div>
                                        <div class="text-cy ml-2">-H "Content-Type: application/json" \</div>
                                        <div class="text-cy ml-2">-d '{</div>
                                        <div class="text-cy ml-4">"jsonrpc": "2.0",</div>
                                        <div class="text-cy ml-4">"id": 2,</div>
                                        <div class="text-cy ml-4">"method": "tools/list",</div>
                                        <div class="text-cy ml-4">"params": {}</div>
                                        <div class="text-cy ml-2">}'</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <div>
                                    <p class="text-white font-semibold mb-2">Search projects:</p>
                                    <div class="bg-ink rounded-lg p-3 font-mono text-xs border border-line overflow-x-auto">
                                        <div class="text-cy">curl -X POST https://mkkai.dev/api/mcp \</div>
                                        <div class="text-cy ml-2">-H "Content-Type: application/json" \</div>
                                        <div class="text-cy ml-2">-d '{</div>
                                        <div class="text-cy ml-4">"jsonrpc": "2.0",</div>
                                        <div class="text-cy ml-4">"id": 3,</div>
                                        <div class="text-cy ml-4">"method": "tools/call",</div>
                                        <div class="text-cy ml-4">"params": {</div>
                                        <div class="text-cy ml-6">"name": "search_projects",</div>
                                        <div class="text-cy ml-6">"arguments": {"technology": "Python"}</div>
                                        <div class="text-cy ml-4">}</div>
                                        <div class="text-cy ml-2">}'</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Available Tools & Resources -->
                    <div>
                        <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">📋 Available Tools & Resources</h4>
                        <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-4 border border-line">
                            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                                <div>
                                    <p class="text-white font-semibold mb-3">🛠️ Tools:</p>
                                    <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-300 text-sm">
                                        <li>• <code class="bg-white/[.02] px-2 py-1 rounded text-cy">search_projects</code> - Search by category/technology/keyword</li>
                                        <li>• <code class="bg-white/[.02] px-2 py-1 rounded text-cy">submit_contact</code> - Send contact form messages</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <p class="text-white font-semibold mb-3">📁 Resources:</p>
                                    <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-300 text-sm">
                                        <li>• <code class="bg-white/[.02] px-2 py-1 rounded text-cy">portfolio://profile</code> - Professional info</li>
                                        <li>• <code class="bg-white/[.02] px-2 py-1 rounded text-cy">portfolio://contact</code> - Contact details</li>
                                        <li>• <code class="bg-white/[.02] px-2 py-1 rounded text-cy">portfolio://projects/all</code> - All projects</li>
                                        <li>• <code class="bg-white/[.02] px-2 py-1 rounded text-cy">portfolio://projects/{id}</code> - Individual projects</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>


        </div>

        
    
    </div>
</article>